      "author": "Gayle Fessenden",
      "handle": "@GayleBreastfeeding",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T19:15:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:15 PM",
      "content": "I'm so looking forward to leading our discussion on 'Advantages of Breastfeeding to Mother and Child' tomorrow morning. It's such a vital part of mothering.",
      "person_id": "p_gayle_f",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2018-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_18_002",
      "type": "post",
      "author": "Gayle Fessenden",
      "handle": "@GayleBreastfeeding",
      "isoDate": "1977-01-12T19:20:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 7:20 PM",
      "content": "For those who were asking, the name LaLeche is Spanish and means \"the milk\". Our group's purpose is to help encourage good mothering through breastfeeding.",
      "person_id": "p_gayle_f",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2018-1.jpg"
    },
    {
