      "displayDate": "Jan 12, 1977 • 8:30 PM",
      "content": "Got the house all ready for the Rockford Group of LaLeche League meeting tomorrow. 9:30 AM at 6846 Woodhills N.E. — all interested mothers and mothers-to-be are welcome!",
      "person_id": "p_joan_z",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-12-1977%20-%20Page%2018-1.jpg"
